    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76766" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλαιότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>age</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ πλῆθος ἐτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					2.42
				</span></i>
			; of seeds, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				7.1.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more freq.
