					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					609e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. γράμματος</span>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινότης πνεύματος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				7.6
			</span></i>; in Lit. Crit., <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				10.19
			</span></i>.</div>
